      "title": "GPT-6 Astra 发布后，Sebastian Raschka 解析 looped transformer 与隐藏推理链传闻",
      "title_en": "GPT-6 Astra， looped transformers， and hidden reasoning",
      "url": "https://magazine.sebastianraschka.com/p/gpt-6-astra-looped-transformers-and",
      "permalink": "https://aihot.news/items/cmtud99z117yurofph84r3cio",
      "source": "Hacker News：AI 热帖",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T14:37:47.000Z",
      "discoveredAt": "2026-09-09T17:22:29.350Z",
      "summary": "OpenAI 发布 GPT-6 Astra，作者评测认为其计算机使用和图像渲染能力尤为突出，ARC-AGI-3 达 99.9%，前代 GPT-5.6 Sol 仅 7.8%。",
