      "fullContent": "Making sovereign, open-weight AI the technology frontier | Mistral\nCategories\nProduct\nResearch\nEngineering\nSolutions\nCompany\nFeatured stories\nASML\nCMA CGM\nHSBC\nBMW\nSee all\nWho we are\nAbout us\nCareers\nBrand\nConnect\nCommunity\nPartners\nHelp center\nStudio\nBuild, test, and run AI agents and apps.\nForge\nTrain, align, and evaluate custom AI models.\nVibe\nAI agent for long-horizon work.\nVibe for code\nCoding agents in the terminal, IDE, and background.\nAI Cloud\nFrontier-scale infrastructure for training and inference.\nPricing\nPlans\nAPI pricing\nFor enterprises\nFinancial services\nPublic sector & government\nManufacturing\nEnergy & utilities\nDomains\nCoding\nDocument intelligence\nSpeech\nApplied AI\nDelivery methodology\nModel customization\nLatest models\nMistral OCR 4\nMistral Medium 3.5\nMistral Small 4\nVoxtral TTS\nDocs\nAPI Reference\nCookbooks\nLatest posts\nModernizing complex legacy code with AI agents.\nMistral raises €3B to make sovereign, open-weight AI the technology frontier\nMistral x HUMAIN\nCategories\nProduct\nResearch\nEngineering\nSolutions\nCompany\nFeatured stories\nASML\nCMA CGM\nHSBC\nBMW\nWho we are\nAbout us\nCareers\nBrand\nConnect\nCommunity\nPartners\nHelp center\nStart building\nStudio\nVibe"
