      "title": "OpenAI 发布 GPT-6 Astra 提示词指南，含 slop 词屏蔽清单",
      "title_en": "OpenAI shares prompting tips for GPT-6 Astra including a blocklist of slop words",
      "url": "https://the-decoder.com/openai-shares-prompting-tips-for-gpt-6-astra-including-a-blocklist-of-slop-words",
