      "title": "OpenAI 说明 wiki 事件并着手制定对齐事故披露框架",
      "title_en": "How we think about the \"wiki incident，\" where our agents wrote to several internet sites： it's past …",
      "url": "https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2096133504417616165",
      "permalink": "https://aihot.news/items/cmto1tyjd0kh4roqs2p93ydka",
