      "fullContent": "OpenAI on X: \"GPT-6 Astra is now available to all Pro, Enterprise, and Business Premium users in ChatGPT Work and Codex. It's also live in the API.\nIt might take a few days to roll out to our Plus and Business users. Thank you for your patience.\" / X Post\nLog in Sign up\nPost\nOpenAI on X: \"GPT-6 Astra is now available to all Pro, Enterprise, and Business Premium users in ChatGPT Work and Codex. It's also live in the API.\nIt might take a few days to roll out to our Plus and Business users. Thank you for your patience.\"\nOpenAI\n@OpenAI\nGPT-6 Astra is now available to all Pro, Enterprise, and Business Premium users in ChatGPT Work and Codex. It's also live in the API.\nIt might take a few days to roll out to our Plus and Business users. Thank you for your patience.\n20:13 · 2026年9月4日 397.3万 Views\n1109\n2525\n3.7万\n2298\nOpenAI\n@OpenAI\nGPT-6 Astra is now available to all Pro, Enterprise, and Business Premium users in ChatGPT Work and Codex. It's also live in the API.\nIt might take a few days to roll out to our Plus and Business users. Thank you for your patience.\n20:13 · 2026年9月4日 397.3万 Views\n1109\n2525\n3.7万\n2298\nOpenAI\n@OpenAI\n9月4日\nIn Chat, GPT-6 Astra powers GPT-6 Pro, now available to all Pro, Business, and Enterprise users.\n106\n77\n1415\n43万\nJohn Greg\n@JohnGregQuantum\n9月4日\nWow! THE TIME HAS COME\n2\n16\n537\n3.6万"
