      "fullContent": "Aravind Srinivas on X: \"Congrats to @OpenAI on building the industry's frontier model: GPT-6 Astra. It's far ahead of every other model on wide and deep research tasks, while also being more cost-effective. We'll be bringing this model up on Perplexity Computer for all Pro and Max users soon!\" / X Post\nLog in Sign up\nPost\nAravind Srinivas on X: \"Congrats to @OpenAI on building the industry's frontier model: GPT-6 Astra. It's far ahead of every other model on wide and deep research tasks, while also being more cost-effective. We'll be bringing this model up on Perplexity Computer for all Pro and Max users soon!\"\nAravind Srinivas\n@AravSrinivas\nCongrats to @ OpenAI on building the industry's frontier model: GPT-6 Astra. It's far ahead of every other model on wide and deep research tasks, while also being more cost-effective. We'll be bringing this model up on Perplexity Computer for all Pro and Max users soon!\nPerplexity\n@perplexity_ai\n9月3日\nWe evaluated GPT-6 Astra on WANDR. It scored 0.682 at $11.98 per task, the highest score of any model we tested.\nGPT-6-Astra scored 13.5% higher than Fable 5.1 at 6.1% lower cost, and 27.0% higher than Opus 5 at 3.3% higher cost.\n21:13 · 2026年9月3日 22.1万 Views\n62\n135\n3138\n248\nAravind Srinivas\n@AravSrinivas\nCongrats to @ OpenAI on building the industry's frontier model: GPT-6 Astra. It's far ahead of every other model on wide and deep research tasks, while also being more cost-effective. We'll be bringing this model up on Perplexity Computer for all Pro and Max users soon!\nPerplexity\n@perplexity_ai\n9月3日\nWe evaluated GPT-6 Astra on WANDR. It scored 0.682 at $11.98 per task, the highest score of any model we tested.\nGPT-6-Astra scored 13.5% higher than Fable 5.1 at 6.1% lower cost, and 27.0% higher than Opus 5 at 3.3% higher cost.\n21:13 · 2026年9月3日 22.1万 Views\n62\n135\n3138\n248\nLurkMoarTV\n@LurkMoarTV\n9月3日\nCan't wait to test this out using my Perplexity Max subscription\n6\n2060\nN